<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-17T23:02:30.401Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 23:02:30 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits in Zamfara attacked a mosque during Subhi prayer, killing Governor Dauda Lawal's aide, burning homes and abducting worshippers, while gunmen in Plateau killed herders, farmers and an Operation Rainbow commander, burned houses and triggered a curfew. President Tinubu apologized for his absence after the Plateau attack and announced a five-year defence plan as AI-generated disinformation spreads ahead of the election. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxNRVg0aXlnWTRHdk81aU1LbThMMktiemtaa0hfRnk4bFdlZWs5aUVYVjlhMGVXVjZQOXNraWNRTGFGMTNFTlJ3aVFwWGUzREphRDRnNlljVE5xZmFkSlVrMDVSOTZ0V2R1VzNfSTNtcU91eEhNeU5teDVuM2JBLVFCaHppNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxPM0ZmYTRGRFlDYW8tejdiSnZEU0NKWnZHZG5GY0lDRmZGQjYyRVc5Ty1vNE1Lbll6WVVIY0kzYzF6Rzd2VDMtQkFnTEY3dFBGQzVZczY0YjBBV0dfMUg4RW1kVHVvS2ZDTUlqWnMyeHdGSVliV2ZkTVJpU0xOLU13OWlLaTBOcjg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTFBNeVpvTFo2c1pmVmNhWXpTOC1oRGxTQkIwTllCN2w3MXRFVFp0Q2x5TVg4UV9kUWRkQUNSN25ocDZWd0QxSlVSTFV3T0NvaFhJZUlFTHVxVVpfTHZQMEFkR0Z2d3NlQXF6NGlmZDFiVWVESXZ3dWVtTEUwQWZXTlE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxNaGhzV0M0WEkwYzBSYVQ2MFJYZWVIMmJ4dGNMNUQxZWNabzNQU0lhU0pyTEFHdVBpVkJzckJpeTg1ZTlkU1BLMk1ubGQ1c2h1Z0J1YzVjb3dSc3BPNElaNWU0U2RjZjJQYzhpTEpHc2RRXzJrS2hEby1aTFMyNnRWNm16V3N3U21vZmpfZ19hMmFyeWFtNnd2RkluUndRUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;LEADERSHIP Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxPdnpFRzdTSlU4Mzlrb2tXLW5DdkNnYldKN3J2VDlLUkdDcXhjcm85clFkelJWaEEtb0NVeGFON1g0RzB